{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii", "title": "公孫丑下", "description": "孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "來", "id": "來"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "告", "id": "吿"}, {"form": "宿", "id": "宿"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "美", "id": "美"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.9660141672265856, "source": "反", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.106080330722856, "source": "反", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.700615222614692, "source": "反", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.8533173622274883, "source": "反", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 3.288401887516811, "source": "美", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.7992275112828016, "source": "美", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.288401887516811, "source": "智", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.8724881092157621, "source": "智", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 0.8724881092157621, "source": "吿", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.2587824703356527, "source": "吿", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 3.0007198150650303, "source": "後", "target": "宿"}, {"weight": 1.3424917384614978, "source": "後", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 3.7992275112828016, "source": "行", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.546464542787434, "source": "行", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 0.4670230011075978, "source": "行", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 0.3418598581535918, "source": "王", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.5656352897757073, "source": "王", "target": "來"}, {"weight": 0.6493445579015524, "source": "王", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.4670230011075978, "source": "王